Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}那双眼中映出的明亮画面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}你一定很爱甜食吧，你说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}丝带、薄纱和芭蕾风
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}他们说，这就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}"喜欢吧？"——来颗马卡龙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}情人节的惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}吞下所有糖衣般的甜蜜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}尽管让我反胃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Te amo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}사랑해
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}愛してる
